+# QPU Provider Validation Runbook
+
+Prereqs:
+ - Provider accounts (AWS, IBM, Azure) with minimal quota
+ - Secrets stored in Secrets Manager or Vault and available to the qpu-worker via IRSA/ExternalSecrets
+ - EVIDENCE_BUCKET configured and qpu-worker has s3 put perms
+
+Steps:
