+7. Upload provider invoice CSVs to s3://<EVIDENCE_BUCKET>/invoices/ for billing reconciliation.
+8. Run billing_reconcile_extended.py to match invoices and update DB.
+
+If any failures, inspect logs:
+ - qpu-worker pod logs
+ - qpu-queue service logs
+ - provider adapter exceptions
